The cumulative C2-C7 adapters were reconstructed from the authenticated
ix-pilot.patch and ix-c3.patch through ix-c7.patch supplied with the former
Lean4Ix consistency work. Original adapter files, patches, source identities,
reports, licenses and differential fixtures are retained in
Tests/Fixtures/Certified/c7-handoff.tar.gz. Individual source and maintained
file identities appear in Tests/Certified/ImportManifest.lean.

Maintained theory imports use Ix.Theory, and the checker wrappers use
Ix.Kernel. The five historical audits now traverse full checked declaration
graphs and transitive runtime workers. The unused historical native profiling
counter module is preserved in the archive but is not maintained or linked.

The set model and its separate attribution are maintained under Ix/Theory.
The old checkout is not a build or test dependency. This handoff archive
contains the selected adapter sources and regression evidence, not the
complete historical Ix base checkout.
